# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file").
# Test-build shortcut check (port/test/konami.mk; port-plan/pending/konami.md):
# the Prologue up to its first free player phase (ticks 0-1995: the start of
# route_ch0_prologue.keys; the cursor is at (4,5)), then the debug-menu keys on
# an empty tile, then the debug menu's Map item to Chapter 2 (port/test/konami.mk).
#   1996       Down: the cursor to (4,6), an empty tile
#   2004-2075  Up Up Down Down Left Right Left Right B, one tick each, 8 ticks apart
#   2076       A: a test build opens the debug menu here; a release build (and the
#              GBA) opens the map menu, as A on an empty tile does
#   2136, 2152 Right, Right: the Map item from the Prologue to Chapter 2
#   2168       A: the Map item's jump
#   2288-3458  Start every 30 ticks (skips scenes; Chapter 2's opening runs as a
#              skirmish and stops in tick 2397 on the GBA too, pending/konami.md)
# Ticks after the last entry have mask 000.
#
# --- route_ch0_prologue.keys, ticks 0-1995 ---
